From 61944466b27fa4c82c35e96a5c0f686680b198aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zxilly <zhouxinyu1001@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 20:00:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 05/22] cmd/compile, cmd/internal/obj: add wasm32 code
 generation

Use the WebAssembly backend for wasm32, with 32-bit pointers and ints
held in 64-bit locals. Preserve pointer types when masking values to
32 bits so stack growth can update spilled pointers.

Handle bounds checks for 64-bit indices and add separate relocations
for function handles and continuations.

Updates #63131

Change-Id: If31fc22346bf6902611e6b56685891f5959066cd

